   "cooked": "<h1>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#tec-rewards-distribution-round-37-301023-to-271123-1\" name=\"tec-rewards-distribution-round-37-301023-to-271123-1\"></a>TEC Rewards Distribution - round-37  - 30/10/23 to 27/11/23</h1>\n<p>This period covers praise given between <strong>30 October 2023 and 27 November 2023</strong>. We allocated <strong>524.9315137</strong> TEC tokens for rewards. Some praise accounts still haven’t been activated so the total amount below will be less than what we set aside to distribute.</p>\n<p>Out of the total rewards:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>90% of the tokens were given as praise rewards <img alt=\":pray:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/pray.png?v=12\" title=\":pray:\" width=\"20\"/>\n</li>\n<li>7% distributed among quantifiers <img alt=\":balance_scale:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/balance_scale.png?v=12\" title=\":balance_scale:\" width=\"20\"/>\n</li>\n<li>3% assigned to the reward board <img alt=\":memo:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/memo.png?v=12\" title=\":memo:\" width=\"20\"/>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This data has been reviewed by the Quantifiers and the Reward Board, and has been submitted for distribution to the <a href=\"https://xdai.aragon.blossom.software/#/rewardboardtec/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Reward Board DAO</a></p>\n<p>You can check out the <a href=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/CommonsBuild/tec-rewards/8fd3b3e407a5eeb22af23b72414e6eb1d3b64816/distribution_rounds/round-37/distribution_results/reports/round-37--general-round-analysis-report.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">full period analysis here</a>. <img alt=\":bar_chart:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/bar_chart.png?v=12\" title=\":bar_chart:\" width=\"20\"/></p>\n<p>This post will be open to the community for review for 48 hours then submitted to the Reward Board for final execution. <img alt=\":heavy_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/heavy_check_mark.png?v=12\" title=\":heavy_check_mark:\" width=\"20\"/></p>\n<p>The Rewards Distribution for this round is as follows:</p>\n<div class=\"md-table\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Username</th>\n<th>Rewards in TEC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Tamarandom#9361</td>\n<td>70.32387662</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>natesuits#4789</td>\n<td>53.36090517</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>bear100</td>\n<td>26.76770439</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>eenti</td>\n<td>31.70967527</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Griff (凋,凋)<span class=\"hashtag\">#8888</span>\n</td>\n<td>22.84460477</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ygg_anderson#4998</td>\n<td>9.802722195</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>nuggan</td>\n<td>10.33782863</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gideonro#0</td>\n<td>10.65513282</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>杉 octopus#5508</td>\n<td>9.802722195</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EFRA#7972</td>\n<td>8.438865194</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JHennyArt#2106</td>\n<td>6.478320755</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>akrtws#4246</td>\n<td>6.478320755</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JeffEmmett#7202</td>\n<td>6.222597567</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>makkiyzy</td>\n<td>5.406565699</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>missing username</td>\n<td>4.848085</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sem(減,雀)<span class=\"hashtag\">#0161</span>\n</td>\n<td>5.114463754</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>curiousrabbit.eth#0790</td>\n<td>4.688258441</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PhilH#1102</td>\n<td>4.262053128</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pat.zip (TE Academy)<span class=\"hashtag\">#5266</span>\n</td>\n<td>4.262053128</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>acidlazzer</td>\n<td>3.659829088</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>zaremba_ax</td>\n<td>4.006329941</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>divine_comedian</td>\n<td>2.994405618</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0xBlockBoy 抄#8972</td>\n<td>2.642472939</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>roro#1166</td>\n<td>2.216267627</td